  "details": "Description\n\nAs described in the title, since the new update, when enabling the multicam stream using the camera dolly system, the additional cameras' transparency stopped working. The green screen option is a temporary solution but I hope for a fix soon enough, as I use this system regularly.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nOpen camera > Mode Stream > Enable Spout camera.\u000bGo to Mask > toggle World.\u000bGo to Dolly camera, mode Multi > put down multiple paths. Any other path than the 1st one won't have transparency enabled.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
